00:04:30.415 --> 00:04:35.600
<v Host>Athletes from forty-five countries and regions across Asia are set to take part.

00:04:36.199 --> 00:04:38.456
<v Vocab>参加

00:04:38.855 --> 00:04:40.872
<v Host>It means participation.

00:04:41.471 --> 00:04:54.192
<v Slow>大会は10月4日までの16日間で、43の競技、469の種目が行われます。

00:04:54.992 --> 00:05:02.791
<v Host>The games run for sixteen days through October fourth, with forty-three sports and four hundred sixty-nine events.

00:05:03.391 --> 00:05:05.696
