00:05:06.096 --> 00:05:08.927
<v Host>It means an individual event in a sport.

00:05:09.528 --> 00:05:18.648
<v Slow>今回の大会では、選手が一緒に泊まる大きな選手村は作られません。

00:05:19.447 --> 00:05:24.944
<v Host>This time, no big athletes' village will be built for everyone to stay in together.

00:05:25.543 --> 00:05:28.160
<v Vocab>選手村

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.911
<v Host>It means an athletes' village.

00:05:31.512 --> 00:05:42.360
<v Slow>建設のお金が高くなったため、選手たちはホテルなど、今ある施設に分かれて泊まります。

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:50.624
<v Host>Because construction costs rose, athletes will stay separately in hotels and other existing facilities.

00:05:51.223 --> 00:05:53.552
<v Vocab>施設

00:05:53.951 --> 00:05:55.680
<v Host>It means a facility.

00:05:56.279 --> 00:06:06.000
<v Slow>開幕を前に、会場の準備や警備の確認も、急ピッチで進んでいます。

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:13.016
<v Host>Ahead of the opening, venue preparations and security checks are moving at a rapid pace.

00:06:13.615 --> 00:06:15.728
<v Vocab>警備

00:06:16.127 --> 00:06:19.055
<v Host>It means security, guarding a place.

